WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.847
Hammerspoon drops Lua

00:00:01.659 --> 00:00:02.696
for JavaScript

00:00:03.222 --> 00:00:04.189
Hammerspoon

00:00:04.224 --> 00:00:05.710
the power-user automation

00:00:05.522 --> 00:00:06.771
tool for macOS

00:00:06.948 --> 00:00:07.809
has released the

00:00:07.621 --> 00:00:08.717
first beta of

00:00:08.529 --> 00:00:09.413
version 2

00:00:09.649 --> 00:00:10.769
a ground-up rewrite

00:00:11.302 --> 00:00:12.221
You now script

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:13.047
it in JavaScript

00:00:12.859 --> 00:00:14.108
on JavaScriptCore

00:00:14.285 --> 00:00:15.276
the same engine

00:00:15.087 --> 00:00:16.207
Safari uses

00:00:16.278 --> 00:00:17.540
to control windows

00:00:17.599 --> 00:00:18.377
hotkeys

00:00:18.507 --> 00:00:19.898
screens audio

00:00:19.981 --> 00:00:21.832
Wi-Fi Shortcuts and

00:00:21.644 --> 00:00:22.233
more

00:00:22.766 --> 00:00:23.980
It needs macOS

00:00:23.792 --> 00:00:24.688
27

00:00:24.818 --> 00:00:25.808
installs as a

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:26.598
separate app with

00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:27.494
its own config

00:00:27.318 --> 00:00:28.591
so Hammerspoon 1

00:00:28.403 --> 00:00:29.086
can stay

00:00:29.193 --> 00:00:30.631
and ships getting-started

00:00:30.443 --> 00:00:31.751
and migration guides

00:00:32.286 --> 00:00:33.300
Full story on

00:00:33.111 --> 00:00:34.007
the dashboard
